Sval: Remove the private session reset button

The private window's Clear Private Session button and its confirmation
panel go, with their startup hook, toolbar placement and migration,
prefs, strings and styles. Firefox's about:privatebrowsing page goes
too: Sval's jar.mn overrides the page's URL with its own, so its markup,
script and style never load. The page's tests go with it. The component
keeps its private-browsing tests, which cover kept behaviour.

